{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useRouteContext"},{"type":"text","value":" method is a hook that returns the current context for the current route. This hook is useful for accessing the current route context in a component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"useroutecontext-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useRouteContext options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useRouteContext"},{"type":"text","value":" hook accepts an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-from-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.from"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The RouteID to match the route context from."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-select-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.select"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(context: RouteContext) => TSelected"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If supplied, this function will be called with the route context object and the return value will be returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useRouteContext"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"useroutecontext-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useRouteContext returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The current context for the current route or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" if a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useRouteContext } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const context = useRouteContext({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n  //    ^ RouteContext\n\n  // OR\n\n  const selected = useRouteContext({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (context) => context.postId,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"useroutecontext-options","text":"useRouteContext options","level":2},{"id":"opts-from-option","text":"opts.from option","level":3},{"id":"opts-select-option","text":"opts.select option","level":3},{"id":"useroutecontext-returns","text":"useRouteContext returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useRouteContext` method is a hook that returns the current context for the current route. This hook is useful for accessing the current route context in a component.\n\n## useRouteContext options\n\nThe `useRouteContext` hook accepts an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.from` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The RouteID to match the route context from.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(context: RouteContext) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the route context object and the return value will be returned from `useRouteContext`.\n\n## useRouteContext returns\n\n- The current context for the current route or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRouteContext } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const context = useRouteContext({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n  //    ^ RouteContext\n\n  // OR\n\n  const selected = useRouteContext({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (context) => context.postId,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useRouteContextHook\ntitle: useRouteContext hook\n---\n\nThe `useRouteContext` method is a hook that returns the current context for the current route. This hook is useful for accessing the current route context in a component.\n\n## useRouteContext options\n\nThe `useRouteContext` hook accepts an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.from` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The RouteID to match the route context from.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(context: RouteContext) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the route context object and the return value will be returned from `useRouteContext`.\n\n## useRouteContext returns\n\n- The current context for the current route or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRouteContext } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const context = useRouteContext({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n  //    ^ RouteContext\n\n  // OR\n\n  const selected = useRouteContext({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (context) => context.postId,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
